---
// A1: Micro-interaction scale on a permanently visible element is NOT a hidden reveal
---
<div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200">
  <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Interactive Card</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-600">This card is always visible and simply animates slightly on hover.</p>
</div>
